									"text": "Mike played a critical role in leading the international expansion of BitGo into new markets, notably Singapore, where he set the foundational framework that paved the way for broader growth into EMEA and LATAM regions. His ability to move quickly and operate hands-on was invaluable because he never waited for perfect conditions, but instead drove initiatives like standing up new trust structures and operationalizing Go Accounts across new tokens and chains in record time."
