									"text": "In addition to his execution strength, Mike consistently brought creative ideas forward, helping us expand BitGo's support for a broader range of digital assets and enhancing the company's global competitiveness. His combination of thoughtful strategic planning and pragmatic, fast-moving delivery made him a critical part of our success."
								}
