							"_type": "block",
							"style": "normal",
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"text": "Mike embodies the best traits of a high-impact product leader: innovative, action-oriented, and deeply committed to building lasting platforms. I would jump at the chance to work with him again."
								}
