									"_type": "span",
									"text": "I'm a product leader with 15 years of experience scaling B2B SaaS platforms and public-sector solutions. I specialize in building 0-to-1 products, shaping long-term strategy, and driving meaningful revenue growth across digital assets, fintech, regtech, and government."
								}
