						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"style": "normal",
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"text": "I'm currently the Institutional Product Lead at CoinTracker, where I led the 0-to-1 build of crypto tax infrastructure supporting 16 brokers. Previously, I built the public sector business at TaxBit from $150K to $5M+ in 24 months, and delivered a government CMS that powers 9,000+ pages."
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"_type": "block",
							"style": "normal",
							"children": [
								{
									"_type": "span",
									"text": "I believe in shipping fast, learning from users, and letting revenue be the ultimate validator. When I'm not building products, I'm exploring how AI can transform everyday workflows\u2014most recently by building a nutrition-tracking app entirely with Claude Code."
